#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:25 23fe12640161461783529ce9060e4b25
msgid ""
"This effect supports makeup gain and a dry/wet mix for parallel compression. Sidechain "
"routing is not implemented; setting "
":ref:`sidechain<class_FmodAudioEffectCompressor_property_sidechain>` only stores the "
"requested bus name."
msgstr ""
"该效果器支持补偿增益和用于并行压缩的干湿混合。当前尚未实现侧链路由；设置  "
":ref:`sidechain<class_FmodAudioEffectCompressor_property_sidechain>`  只会保存请求的总线名称。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:126 44be04723a6041a892fb82d19b2ee80d
msgid ""
"The compression ratio, clamped to 1.0 through 48.0. The default is 4.0: for every 4 dB the "
"input exceeds the threshold, the output increases by 1 dB."
msgstr "压缩比，限制在 1.0 到 48.0，默认为 4.0。输入超过阈值 4 dB 时，输出增加 1 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:143 01d149ca52f541e19bd20c459efa9b5d
msgid ""
"The makeup gain applied after compression, in decibels. Clamped to -20.0 through +20.0 dB; "
"the default is 0.0 dB."
msgstr "压缩后的补偿增益，单位为分贝。限制在 -20.0 到 +20.0 dB，默认为 0.0 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:160 da20706bc317404194420e7a2f40cc07
msgid ""
"The requested attack time in microseconds, clamped to 20.0 through 2000.0. The stored default"
" is 20.0 microseconds. The value is converted to milliseconds for FMOD and clamped to a "
"minimum of 0.1 ms, so requests below 100 microseconds use an effective attack time of 100 "
"microseconds."
msgstr ""
"请求的启动时间，单位为微秒，限制在 20.0 到 2000.0，保存的默认值为 20.0 微秒。传给 FMOD 时会转换为毫秒，并限制为至少 0.1 ms，因此小于 100 "
"微秒的请求实际使用 100 微秒。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:177 0f4d69a1ea92474bb1bc1d047bfd8262
msgid ""
"The release time in milliseconds, clamped to 20.0 through 2000.0. The default is 250.0 ms. It"
" controls how quickly compression recovers after the input level falls below the threshold."
msgstr "释放时间，单位为毫秒，限制在 20.0 到 2000.0，默认为 250.0 ms。控制输入电平低于阈值后压缩恢复的速度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:211 30ca1b74d71a454380ae00bc521eaa0f
msgid ""
"Stores a requested sidechain bus name. Sidechain routing is not implemented, so this property"
" does not change which signal controls compression. The default is an empty name."
msgstr "保存请求的侧链总线名称。当前尚未实现侧链路由，因此该属性不会改变用于控制压缩的信号，默认为空名称。"
